  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Call the ScaleClusterNodePool operation to scale out a node pool, which adds more nodes to support your workloads. The count parameter must be greater than the current number of nodes in the pool. If a node pool contains failed nodes, first call the DeleteClusterNodes operation to remove them before scaling out the pool. A scale-out operation typically completes in 5 to 10 minutes. If the operation takes longer than one hour, it has failed. Contact technical support",
  "description_zh": "您可以调用ScaleClusterNodePool对节点进行扩容，以保证节点数量足够支撑业务运行。\ncount 参数必需大于当前节点池的节点数。如果节点池中存在扩容失败的 node（failed node），则必需使用 DeleteClusterNodes 接口删除对应 node 后进行扩容。\n节点扩容正常耗时在5-10分钟内，超过1小时为扩容失败，请联系技术支持",
